02:28:14.251 --> 02:28:17.459
♪ Ours to take? ♪


02:28:19.167 --> 02:28:23.751
♪ Bathed in lightning ♪


02:28:23.876 --> 02:28:27.501
♪ Bathed in heat ♪


02:28:42.001 --> 02:28:44.917
♪ All is well ♪


02:28:45.042 --> 02:28:50.167
♪ As long as we keep spinning ♪


02:28:54.292 --> 02:28:57.251
♪ Here now ♪


02:28:57.376 --> 02:29:01.917
♪ Dancing behind the wall ♪


02:29:06.584 --> 02:29:09.501
♪ Hear the old songs ♪


02:29:09.626 --> 02:29:14.417
♪ And laughter within ♪


02:29:20.334 --> 02:29:23.834
♪ All forgiven ♪


02:29:23.959 --> 02:29:28.876
